        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SS35R5U32D-R,  3-1/2\" x 3-1/2\"x 5/8 Radius Residential Grade Stainless Steel Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of 3-1/2 Inch Residential Stainless Hinges (2), matching Stainless Steel flathead, and Phillips Drive #9 x 3/4\" wood screws. The 3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x 5/8 Radius Residential Stainless Steel Hinge has a removable, stainless steel pin. This satin stainless door hinge has a template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS35R5U32D.jpg?v=1704354739\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SS35R5U32D-R Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3-1/2 Inch Residential Stainless Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Radius: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #9 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS35R5U32D.pdf?v=1704262169\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SS35R5U32D-R Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
